<title>USA: Thomas &amp; Betts to buy electric meter firm.</title>
<headline>Thomas &amp; Betts to buy electric meter firm.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thomas &amp; Betts Corp said Thursday it has reached a definitive agreement to acquire Microelectric Canada Ltd for an undisclosed amount of case.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to close by the end of November.</p>
<p>Microelectric is based in Montreal. It manufactures electric meter boxes and accessories.</p>
<p>Thomas &amp; Betts produces connectors and components for electrical and electronic markets.</p>
</text>
